WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.620
The common people trudged through heavy rain along the muddy road with great difficulty.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.980
The rain had delayed their journey, and everyone was tired and worried.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.910
In a small shelter at Dazexiang, Chen Sheng and Wu Guang discussed their plight anxiously.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:19.220
Qin law was harsh — arriving late meant punishment — so why not rise up and resist?

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:25.360
Chen Sheng raised the great banner and Wu Guang lifted his farm tools, calling everyone to resist.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.960
The farmers responded one after another, their morale high.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:34.300
More and more common people joined the ranks, holding torches.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.380
Chen Sheng waved the great banner, and every face was full of hope.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:43.140
The torches grew brighter and brighter, and the cheers rose wave after wave.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:49.140
At dawn, the rebel army stood on the hillside, gazing at the rising sun.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:54.940
This uprising inspired the whole country, and Qin rule began to collapse.

